  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): optimize memory management and pool lifecycle\n\n      - Pool: centralize finalizer management by moving GC logic to Pool<T>\n      - HttpModel: optimize Clone() to reuse internal list buffers; set initial capacities\n      - Logging: decouple Utf8Builder formatting from LogManager domain logic\n      - Fix: resolve static initialization deadlock via lazy loading in RouteHandler\n      - Performance: reduce GC pressure and allocations in high-concurrency hotspots",
